cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this REMARK, cite it as below.
type: software
title: Reproducing “Economic Scenarios for Transformative AI”
abstract: An Econ-ARK REMARK that reimplements the monthly model of Korinek, Jones, Sacher, Cotter,
  and McCrory (2026) and records the twelve inputs, definitions, and orderings a reimplementation
  needs beyond the paper's text, most of which can be read from the authors' scenario explorer. The
  reimplementation agrees with the authors' scenario explorer in every series and month to rounding
  error and reproduces all 226 published numbers within the paper's printed rounding. One script fails
  when any number stops reproducing.
